  dict(t="box",p=["Adam was twelve. He had heard the phrase a thousand times — <em>Allah gives sabr to those who are patient</em> — but nobody had ever explained how a boy is supposed to <em>do</em> patience while his chest feels like a full washing machine. One night at the small kitchen table he snapped at his little sister over nothing, slammed his room door, and cried with his face in the blanket."]),
