  dict(t="box",p=["In May, Baba found work — not the old one, a new one. In June, Mama walked Adam to his exams. The flat was still small. The laptop was still 'later.' But the family had discovered something: they had grown stronger than the year. That is the quiet profit of sabr — you do not just survive hard seasons, you come out of them with muscle that did not exist before."]),
