  dict(t="box",p=["Zayd spiralled. He asked seven people what to do, redrew the pros-and-cons list three times, and slept badly for two nights — because the truth nobody said out loud was this: <em>none of the answers could be KNOWN.</em> That is what uncertainty IS. His mother watched him for a day, then said: 'Ya habibi, let me show you the two hands.'"]),
