  dict(t="box",p=["Zayd did his part for six days, slept properly for the first time on night two, and chose camp. Half of science week's 'magic' turned out to be videos the teacher could have shown on any Tuesday. The camp was one of the hardest, best weeks of his summer — and his best friend there is now his team captain. Not because he guessed right, but because he DID his part and LET GO of the part he never owned."]),
