  dict(ar="يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱسْتَعِينُوا۟ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِ", en="O you who have believed, seek help through patience and prayer.", ref="Surah Al-Baqarah 2:153 — the companion verse: pain has its own worship"),
