 quran_post=["Look at the design: Allah commanded THANKS when good arrives, and PATIENCE when pain arrives — the same heart, two doors. The false rule people invent is 'you must feel thankful right now or you are an ingrate.' The real rule: be patient in the wound and grateful in the gift — and both come to the same Allah."],
 balance="Important balance: gratitude is NOT forced happiness, and thanking Allah does NOT mean the wound is approved. The divorce hurt. The prize was true. The Prophet ﷺ cried at graves and still said alhamdulillah. Two hands in the same prayer.",
