 ch_note="If joy keeps feeling forbidden weeks after a loss, tell an adult — sometimes hearts need company (and professionals) to unlock both doors again. There is no sin in needing help to grieve well.",
 avoid=["\"Count your blessings — stop being sad!\"","\"You should be over it by now.\"","Saying 'alhamdulillah' like a period at the end of a sentence instead of an opening for both hands."],
