 choice="TURN (face your real part honestly + istighfar) → HOPE (read 39:53 & 12:87 as YOUR addresses) → ONE STEP (the smallest real action — not a grand plan) → AGAIN (when you fall: pause, istighfar, restart the SAME DAY — as many times as it takes).",
